{
    "Visual_LandingPage_Heading": "Drag an On/Off column into Toggles",
    "Visual_LandingPage_Heading.comment": "Landing page heading (next to an info icon) shown before any field is bound to the Toggles data role.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_Hint": "Each column accepts On/Off, True/False or 1/0. One column makes a single toggle; several make a group.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_Hint.comment": "Small print under the landing page's skeleton preview, naming the accepted value formats and the one-column-per-toggle model up front so a report author doesn't have to hit the validation message first.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideTableIntro": "1. Create one table with a column per toggle. Rename the columns; each name becomes that toggle's name:",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideTableIntro.comment": "First step of the copyable starter-DAX guide on the landing page, introducing the CROSSJOIN table code block below it.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideMeasureIntro": "2. Add a measure for each toggle (1 when On, 0 when Off):",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideMeasureIntro.comment": "Second step of the starter-DAX guide, introducing the SELECTEDVALUE measure code block below it.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyButton": "Copy",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyButton.comment": "Button label on each starter-DAX code block. Also the label it's restored to after the brief \"Copied!\"/\"Copy failed\" confirmation.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyButton_Copied": "Copied!",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyButton_Copied.comment": "Replaces the Copy button's label for ~1.5s after a successful copy.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyButton_Failed": "Copy failed",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyButton_Failed.comment": "Replaces the Copy button's label for ~1.5s if both clipboard approaches fail (e.g. denied by the host's iframe sandbox).",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyTable_AriaLabel": "Copy the group table DAX",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyTable_AriaLabel.comment": "Accessible name for the Copy button on the DATATABLE code block.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyMeasure_AriaLabel": "Copy the measure DAX",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyMeasure_AriaLabel.comment": "Accessible name for the Copy button on the SELECTEDVALUE measure code block.",
    "Visual_Validation_OnOffRequired": "\"{0}\" must contain exactly one On value and one Off value (\"On\"/\"Off\", \"True\"/\"False\", or 1/0). Build the group table from one On/Off column per toggle - see the starter DAX on this visual's landing page.",
    "Visual_Validation_OnOffRequired.comment": "Shown once a field is bound to Toggles or Group enable but its values don't match one of the accepted On/Off patterns. {0} is the offending field's display name - keep the token intact when translating.",
    "Visual_Switch_AriaLabel": "{0}: {1} / {2} toggle, currently {3}",
    "Visual_Switch_AriaLabel.comment": "Accessible name for a row drawn with the toggle skin. {0} is the row's name (its field's display name, or the master label); {1} and {2} are the report's Off/On labels from the Format pane; {3} is whichever of them is currently active (or Visual_State_Mixed). ILocalizationManager has no format-argument support, so these are replaced by literal position in code - keep the {N} tokens intact when translating and reorder them (not the surrounding words) if the target language needs a different word order.",
    "Visual_Checkbox_AriaLabel": "{0}: {1} / {2} checkbox, currently {3}",
    "Visual_Checkbox_AriaLabel.comment": "Same as Visual_Switch_AriaLabel, used instead when a row is announced as role=\"checkbox\" (the checkbox skin, header rows under the radio skin, or radio-skinned rows outside Only one active). Same {0}/{1}/{2}/{3} token contract.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideRepeat": "3. Drag each toggle's column into Toggles. To add a toggle later, add another DATATABLE line to the CROSSJOIN.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideRepeat.comment": "Third step of the starter-DAX guide, after the measure code block.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideEnableIntro": "Optional - Group enable: add a \"Group Enable\" column to the same CROSSJOIN and drag it into Group enable. Switching it Off greys out the toggles without resetting them. To make your numbers follow it too, return 0 from each measure while it is Off:",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideEnableIntro.comment": "Optional final step of the starter-DAX guide, introducing the gated-measure code block below it. Keep the \"Group Enable\" column name in sync with the DAX code block, which isn't localized.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyGate_AriaLabel": "Copy the group-enable measure DAX",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopyGate_AriaLabel.comment": "Accessible name for the Copy button on the gated (Group enable) measure code block.",
    "Visual_Radio_AriaLabel": "{0}: {1} / {2} option, currently {3}",
    "Visual_Radio_AriaLabel.comment": "Same as Visual_Switch_AriaLabel, used instead when a row is announced as role=\"radio\" (the radio skin under Only one active). Same {0}/{1}/{2}/{3} token contract.",
    "Visual_State_Mixed": "Mixed",
    "Visual_State_Mixed.comment": "The master switch's state when only some of the toggles below it are On. Used in its accessible name and tooltip.",
    "Visual_MasterLabel_Default": "All",
    "Visual_MasterLabel_Default.comment": "Shown as the master switch's name until a report author sets their own Master label - resolved via ILocalizationManager (like Visual_TitleText_Default) since it's likely to go untouched.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_Tabs_AriaLabel": "Setup example",
    "Visual_LandingPage_Tabs_AriaLabel.comment": "Accessible name of the tab strip that switches the starter-DAX guide between a single toggle and a group.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_Tab_Single": "One toggle",
    "Visual_LandingPage_Tab_Group": "Toggle group",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideSingleTableIntro": "1. Create a table with one On/Off column. Rename the column; its name becomes the toggle's name:",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideSingleMeasureIntro": "2. Add a measure that reads the toggle (1 when On, 0 when Off):",
    "Visual_LandingPage_GuideSingleDrag": "3. Drag the column into Toggles, then use the measure anywhere in your model.",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopySingleTable_AriaLabel": "Copy the single toggle table DAX",
    "Visual_LandingPage_CopySingleMeasure_AriaLabel": "Copy the single toggle measure DAX",
    "Visual_GroupLabel_Text_Default": "Toggle group",
    "Visual_GroupLabel_Text_Default.comment": "Shown as the Toggle Group Label's own runtime text whenever a report author hasn't set one yet (the property has no persisted value) - resolved via ILocalizationManager rather than a hardcoded default in settings.ts.",
